# Chunky
# Pre-generate chunks to reduce lag when players explore.
# Highly recommended for survival servers.
#
# Download:
# - Modrinth: https://modrinth.com/plugin/chunky
# - Hangar / Spigot also available
#
# Supports 1.21.x (Paper/Spigot compatible)
# Place the .jar file in this folder.
# Usage example: /chunky start world 1000
